  "description": "Ji-woo, a sweet rabbit, goes on a blind date with Inseong, a snake, by recommendation of her parents. When she opens her eyes after getting drunk, what she sees in front of her is Inseong's XX? \n\nBut not one, but two? \n\n«You…why two?» \n\n«Jiwoo, snakes have two XX.» \n\n«What?!» \n\nOne is too much, but two? I think I'll never get married!\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/SnakeBunny), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/snake_and_rabbit_marry), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_000066938), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=11900301) \n\n**Official Translations:**  \n[T.Chinese](https://www.bomtoon.tw/detail/SnakeBunny), [Thai](https://www.boomtoon.com/detail/snake_n_bunny)",
